  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#fd47d9\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">Minecraft 中的 Wii Party</span><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">歡迎來到我們在 Minecraft 中重現的 Wii Party</span><br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">體驗經典的「棋盤遊戲島」，您將擲骰子移動 90 格，沿途面對各種挑戰與驚喜。首位完成最終挑戰的玩家即獲勝。<br></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">棋盤還包含 25 款可遊玩的小遊戲，讓您獲得額外骰子走得更遠！</span></span></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">每個小遊戲以及 2 款額外小遊戲也可在大廳單獨遊玩！</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">資訊：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">版本：</span> 1.21.1</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>玩家人數：</strong> 2-4 人</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>遊戲時長：</strong> 1 小時</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>資源包：</strong> 已包含於世界檔案中的 resources.zip<br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>難度：</strong> 和平</span></span></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#fd47d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">免費在 StickyPiston 上開設伺服器！</span><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"> <a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrial.stickypiston.co%252fmap%252fwiipartyinmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此連結</a></span><br></span><span style=\"color:#7a74ff\"><span style=\"color:#5c7bff\">加入我們的 Discord 回報錯誤或尋找玩家！</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.co%252fCxhQdF9USk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此連結</a></span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#fd47d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;font-size:36px\">警告：請勿使用 Optifine/Paper/Spigot/Bukkit 遊玩，否則地圖將損壞</span></span></span></h3>",
